(5878642, 855873, 17507, '<td valign="top">Kinda weird, but I like it. Technically, I think you should have shot this at a smaller aperture to get the foreground silhouettes as sharp as the light in the background. A noise-reduction program like NeatImage would have nicely cleaned up the dark areas. Also, the foreground figures are just kind of straddling the cusp between silhouetted and detailed--I''d have preferred that they simply be solid black shapes.</td>', 'Kinda weird, but I like it. Technically, I think you should have shot this at a smaller aperture to get the foreground silhouettes as sharp as the light in the background. A noise-reduction program like NeatImage would have nicely cleaned up the dark areas. Also, the foreground figures are just kind of straddling the cusp between silhouetted and detailed--I''d have preferred that they simply be solid black shapes.', '2010-02-24 00:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5878644, 856038, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cool shot... I think you''d have been better off with a shorter exposure, as well as an external flash to make the figure clear.</td>', 'Cool shot... I think you''d have been better off with a shorter exposure, as well as an external flash to make the figure clear.', '2010-02-24 00:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
