(5880277, 856026, 81362, '<td valign="top">High points for creative pose and use of light. Clouds add a lot to the image.</td>', 'High points for creative pose and use of light. Clouds add a lot to the image.', '2010-02-24 22:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880278, 856292, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot even though I can come up with a bunch of reasons not to - excess negative space, man''s chin hidden by shadow, wristwatch as a distraction ... all overcome by the implied glimpse into a relationship with our imagination filling in the context. Glad to see this  hauntingly intimate capture.</td>', 'I like this a lot even though I can come up with a bunch of reasons not to - excess negative space, man''s chin hidden by shadow, wristwatch as a distraction ... all overcome by the implied glimpse into a relationship with our imagination filling in the context. Glad to see this  hauntingly intimate capture.', '2010-02-24 22:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880279, 856252, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fun lighting, reminds me of good images on the strobist site. Hope you share your technique.</td>', 'Fun lighting, reminds me of good images on the strobist site. Hope you share your technique.', '2010-02-24 22:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880281, 856101, 81362, '<td valign="top">A classic keeper. Great capture of motion and expression, with wise choice of processing.</td>', 'A classic keeper. Great capture of motion and expression, with wise choice of processing.', '2010-02-24 22:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880282, 855644, 81362, '<td valign="top">Getting just the essence of blur motion is a lot more difficult than it looks. Kudos on a very good capure.</td>', 'Getting just the essence of blur motion is a lot more difficult than it looks. Kudos on a very good capure.', '2010-02-24 22:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880283, 855843, 81362, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression. These colors work better together than I expected at first glance. Should score well.</td>', 'Priceless expression. These colors work better together than I expected at first glance. Should score well.', '2010-02-24 22:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880286, 856161, 81362, '<td valign="top">Bumping up to 8 on second pass, for originality and lighting -- and to counteract voters who automatically hate poor Woody.</td>', 'Bumping up to 8 on second pass, for originality and lighting -- and to counteract voters who automatically hate poor Woody.', '2010-02-24 22:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880319, 856114, 12796, '<td valign="top">nice composition. I would have loved to see the girls face in focus.</td>', 'nice composition. I would have loved to see the girls face in focus.', '2010-02-24 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880321, 856221, 12796, '<td valign="top">lighting a little too harsh. possibly built in camera flash? cute little girl.. but if she had kept her eyes open, it would have been a much better shot.</td>', 'lighting a little too harsh. possibly built in camera flash? cute little girl.. but if she had kept her eyes open, it would have been a much better shot.', '2010-02-24 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880323, 856043, 12796, '<td valign="top">great composition.. love this shot. IMHO, i would love to see more sharpness on the front girl. 6</td>', 'great composition.. love this shot. IMHO, i would love to see more sharpness on the front girl. 6', '2010-02-24 23:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
