(5880400, 856027, 52130, '<td valign="top">oh wow that really creeped me out at first glance. Good job, lol</td>', 'oh wow that really creeped me out at first glance. Good job, lol', '2010-02-25 02:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880431, 856177, 107519, '<td valign="top">It''s just beatiful, love the posture!</td>', 'It''s just beatiful, love the posture!', '2010-02-25 03:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880447, 856033, 104841, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, though I don''t think it fits I think he is skipping stones. I would have cropped out the top part of the image or used a shallow dept of field the blur it out. I would have also tried to include some more of the reflection.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, though I don''t think it fits I think he is skipping stones. I would have cropped out the top part of the image or used a shallow dept of field the blur it out. I would have also tried to include some more of the reflection.', '2010-02-25 05:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880449, 856067, 104841, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I dont see how this related to the challenge. I would have liked more depth of field so that more of the image is in ''focus'' as to show of the water bubble.</td>', 'Sorry but I dont see how this related to the challenge. I would have liked more depth of field so that more of the image is in ''focus'' as to show of the water bubble.', '2010-02-25 05:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880452, 855295, 104841, '<td valign="top">looks like a great place to get some dynamic shots, to me this looks too much like a tourist shot. I think you needed to take a more creative approach with this shot.</td>', 'looks like a great place to get some dynamic shots, to me this looks too much like a tourist shot. I think you needed to take a more creative approach with this shot.', '2010-02-25 06:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880453, 856186, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice camera angle. It is trick to get a good shot into the sun, here the top half of the shot looks rather grey. One way to get around this is to use a flash to "overpower" the sun. Have a look at some other shots with strong back lighting.</td>', 'nice camera angle. It is trick to get a good shot into the sun, here the top half of the shot looks rather grey. One way to get around this is to use a flash to "overpower" the sun. Have a look at some other shots with strong back lighting.', '2010-02-25 06:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880454, 856313, 104841, '<td valign="top">sorry you have lost me with this shot.</td>', 'sorry you have lost me with this shot.', '2010-02-25 06:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880455, 856191, 104841, '<td valign="top">good use of the rule of a thirds. I am not quite sure what you are trying to do here though. I also think you were a little bit early on the shutter here a fraction of a second latter so his back is not facing the camera.</td>', 'good use of the rule of a thirds. I am not quite sure what you are trying to do here though. I also think you were a little bit early on the shutter here a fraction of a second latter so his back is not facing the camera.', '2010-02-25 06:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880456, 855665, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice enough shot for a mobile phone. try to get into a better position to take the shot so you don''t need to crop as much.</td>', 'nice enough shot for a mobile phone. try to get into a better position to take the shot so you don''t need to crop as much.', '2010-02-25 06:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880457, 855202, 104841, '<td valign="top">try to time it so her eyes are open maybe get a little bit closer as well so you dont have people like the guy with the white shit blocking the action.</td>', 'try to time it so her eyes are open maybe get a little bit closer as well so you dont have people like the guy with the white shit blocking the action.', '2010-02-25 06:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880459, 856066, 104841, '<td valign="top">I get what you are trying to do but I think it would have helped if he was holding the brolly up higher and we could clearly see both arms.</td>', 'I get what you are trying to do but I think it would have helped if he was holding the brolly up higher and we could clearly see both arms.', '2010-02-25 06:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880460, 854894, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice take on the challenge and I like the shadow in the back ground but it appears to be out of focus for not real reason.</td>', 'nice take on the challenge and I like the shadow in the back ground but it appears to be out of focus for not real reason.', '2010-02-25 06:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880462, 854972, 104841, '<td valign="top">having taken photos at weddings it is tough to deal with the low light and it looks like your shot is suffering from it and these is no easy way to fix that. Also the father of the bride does like a little bit posed and unnatural.</td>', 'having taken photos at weddings it is tough to deal with the low light and it looks like your shot is suffering from it and these is no easy way to fix that. Also the father of the bride does like a little bit posed and unnatural.', '2010-02-25 06:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880463, 856229, 104841, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to get up higher to show off more people line dancing. Perhaps even try for a more dynamic moment.</td>', 'I think you needed to get up higher to show off more people line dancing. Perhaps even try for a more dynamic moment.', '2010-02-25 06:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880464, 856169, 104841, '<td valign="top">Good job for getting out to a dance comp for the challenge. I think there are two thinking lacking in your shot though. I would have used a shallower depth of field to isolate the dancers we dont really care about the back ground. I would have also timed it differently (or used a different position) so that I could catch at least one of their faces.</td>', 'Good job for getting out to a dance comp for the challenge. I think there are two thinking lacking in your shot though. I would have used a shallower depth of field to isolate the dancers we dont really care about the back ground. I would have also timed it differently (or used a different position) so that I could catch at least one of their faces.', '2010-02-25 06:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880465, 856233, 104841, '<td valign="top">I wold have liked to see your models face. Also if you include a window you need to make sure it is straight other wise it looks like you have made a mistake.</td>', 'I wold have liked to see your models face. Also if you include a window you need to make sure it is straight other wise it looks like you have made a mistake.', '2010-02-25 06:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880466, 856150, 104841, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I think you have been too heavy handed with the contrast though it appears as though most of the models skin tone has blown out.</td>', 'Nice composition. I think you have been too heavy handed with the contrast though it appears as though most of the models skin tone has blown out.', '2010-02-25 06:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880467, 856041, 104841, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to wait for the dancer to move more to the right so his face does not look so grey from the back lighting.</td>', 'I think you needed to wait for the dancer to move more to the right so his face does not look so grey from the back lighting.', '2010-02-25 06:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880468, 856043, 104841, '<td valign="top">good timing with the shot. The leading girl looks slightly out of focus though and the back ground looks rather ''messy'' maybe a slightly different angle would have helped.</td>', 'good timing with the shot. The leading girl looks slightly out of focus though and the back ground looks rather ''messy'' maybe a slightly different angle would have helped.', '2010-02-25 06:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880469, 855873, 104841, '<td valign="top">Is this a Bokeh shot or did you get the little dancers another way?</td>', 'Is this a Bokeh shot or did you get the little dancers another way?', '2010-02-25 06:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880479, 856026, 20577, '<td valign="top">Blue. I''m calling it.</td>', 'Blue. I''m calling it.', '2010-02-25 07:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
