(5880985, 855644, 49788, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Nice tones, well framed. Love how you have a mirror effect without the mirror. The sense of motion in the photo is fantastic. Only criticism is that I would have liked more sharpness in the face. Looks like this may have been a small part of a larger image? Overall outstanding.</td>', 'Very nice image. Nice tones, well framed. Love how you have a mirror effect without the mirror. The sense of motion in the photo is fantastic. Only criticism is that I would have liked more sharpness in the face. Looks like this may have been a small part of a larger image? Overall outstanding.', '2010-02-25 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880986, 855644, 102315, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image.', '2010-02-25 17:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5880987, 855459, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit with great tones. Would have liked to see a greater sense of motion.</td>', 'Nicely lit with great tones. Would have liked to see a greater sense of motion.', '2010-02-25 17:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
