(5887694, 856067, 86628, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out how to add something to the photographer''s comments, maybe I should be a paid-up member?<br/> <br/>Anyway, I''m very chuffed with my first brown, and with all the interesting comments.  But, I''m sad to say that this is mainly due to a mistake on my side.  This is a photograph of a water drop on a very hairy leaf.  I liked the abstract swirls that it made in the water, and thought it might be a good contender for some interesting comments and a very low place (maybe brown?) in the <i>"In the Garden II"</i> challenge.  Then I went and entered it in the wrong challenge by mistake!<br/> <br/>So, for the DNMC comments - you''re spot on!  For the others, who saw a bit more in it than even I did - thanks a bunch!</td>', 'I can''t figure out how to add something to the photographer''s comments, maybe I should be a paid-up member? Anyway, I''m very chuffed with my first brown, and with all the interesting comments.  But, I''m sad to say that this is mainly due to a mistake on my side.  This is a photograph of a water drop on a very hairy leaf.  I liked the abstract swirls that it made in the water, and thought it might be a good contender for some interesting comments and a very low place (maybe brown?) in the "In the Garden II" challenge.  Then I went and entered it in the wrong challenge by mistake! So, for the DNMC comments - you''re spot on!  For the others, who saw a bit more in it than even I did - thanks a bunch!', '2010-03-03 00:31:31.000000', NULL, 0),
