(5888766, 856161, 28427, '<td valign="top">The dust spots are indeed slightly distracting but the light is great.<br/>I always like photographs of Woody.  The little guy seems to be master of different disciplines.  Here he shows how good he is in pole dancing and a lot of dancers would envy his flexibility.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-03 13:24:59.</i></td>', 'The dust spots are indeed slightly distracting but the light is great.I always like photographs of Woody.  The little guy seems to be master of different disciplines.  Here he shows how good he is in pole dancing and a lot of dancers would envy his flexibility.', '2010-03-03 13:24:03.000000', '2010-03-03 13:24:59.000000', 0),
