(6330346, 856027, 11769, '<td valign="top">You have no shame.<br/> <br/>This is so funny, I can''t stop laughing. I''ve been away from the site a couple years and now back I spend some time looking at older challenges. I stumbled upon this. Ben I''ve seen the thumb of you portrait and through it was strange, feet dancing with a chicken, now I see there is a reason. Not a chicken at all. Thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'You have no shame. This is so funny, I can''t stop laughing. I''ve been away from the site a couple years and now back I spend some time looking at older challenges. I stumbled upon this. Ben I''ve seen the thumb of you portrait and through it was strange, feet dancing with a chicken, now I see there is a reason. Not a chicken at all. Thanks for the laugh.', '2011-02-24 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
